<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/eng@/~part_II__cl_13__subsec_8> <https://schema.org/text> "The meetings of a committee shall be held at such times and places as the chairman of the committee may determine."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/eng@> .
