<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/eng@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Subject to this Act, the Minister may, from time to time, by order published in the Gazette, appoint a vesting date and on such date all properties, rights, interests, obligations and liabilities of the Government specified by the Minister in such order relating to the administration of loan under the repealed Act shall, by virtue of this Act, be transferred to and vested in the Board without any conveyance, assignment or transfer."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/eng@> .
