<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/eng@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Every property, right, interest, obligation and liability transferred to and vested in the Board by virtue of subsection (1) shall be so transferred to and vested in the Board for the like title, estate or interest and on the like tenure as the property, right, interest, obligation and liability were vested or held immediately before the vesting date."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/eng@> .
