<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/eng@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Any pending legal proceedings by or against the Government which relates to any property, right, interest, obligation or liability transferred to and vested in the Board by virtue of subsection (1) may, on and after the vesting date, be continued by or against the Board."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/eng@> .
