<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/eng@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "In the case of rights, interests, obligations and liabilities arising under any loan which are vested in the Board on the vesting date, the Board may enter into such agreements or arrangements over such rights, interests, obligations and liabilities with the Government or any other person."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/eng@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_6> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/eng@/~part_II__cl_4> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/eng@> .
