<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/eng@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_6> <https://schema.org/text> "Where by virtue of subsection (1), any property is transferred to and vested in the Board, the provisions of Part Thirty of the National Land Code 1965 [Act 56 of 1965] shall, for the purpose of effecting the registration of such vesting, apply to the Board."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/eng@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_7> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/eng@/~part_II__cl_4> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/eng@> .
