<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The common seal of the Board shall bear such device as the Board may approve and such seal may be broken, changed, altered and made anew by the Board as it deems fit."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/eng@/~part_II__cl_5> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/eng@> .
