<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The common seal of the Board shall be kept in the custody of the Chairman and shall be authenticated by any two members of the Board authorized by the Board, or by one member of the Board and the Chairman."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/eng@/~part_II__cl_5> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/eng@> .
