<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "All deeds, documents and other instruments purporting to be sealed with the common seal and authenticated in accordance with subsection (3) shall, until the contrary is proved, be deemed to have been validly executed."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/eng@> .
