<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/eng@/~part_IV__cl_23__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "An eligible person who is entitled to apply for a home financing facility from a State Government, statutory body or local authority which has its own home financing scheme shall not be eligible for a public sector home financing facility."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/eng@> .
