<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/eng@/~part_IV__cl_23__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "The amount of the public sector home financing facility granted to an approved eligible person under paragraph (3)(i) shall not exceed the amount for which the deceased person was eligible before his death."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/eng@> .
