<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/eng@/~part_VII__cl_35__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Any function or power delegated under this section shall be performed and exercised in the name and on behalf of the Board."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/eng@> .
