<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/eng@/~part_VII__cl_35__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "A delegation under this section shall not preclude the Board itself from performing or exercising at any time any of the delegated functions or powers. Power of Minister to give directions"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/eng@> .
