<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/eng@/~part_VII__cl_38> <https://schema.org/text> "The Public Authorities Protection Act 1948 [Act 198] shall apply to any action, suit, prosecution or proceedings against the Board, any member of the Board or committee, or any employee of the Board in respect of any act, neglect or default done or committed or any omission by it or him in good faith, in such capacity. Public servants"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/eng@> .
