<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/eng@/~part_VII__cl_39> <https://schema.org/text> "All members of the Board and committee and employees of the Board, while discharging their duties under this Act, shall be deemed to be public servants within the meaning of the Penal Code [Act 574]. Representation in civil proceedings"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/eng@> .
