<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/eng@/~part_V__cl_29> <https://schema.org/text> "The Board shall open and maintain an account or accounts with such bank or banks as the Board deems fit, and every such account shall be operated as far as practicable by cheques signed by any person as may, from time to time, be authorized by the Board. Statutory Bodies (Accounts and Annual Reports) Act 1980"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/eng@> .
