<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/eng@/~part_V__cl_30> <https://schema.org/text> "The Statutory Bodies (Accounts and Annual Reports) Act 1980 [Act 240] shall apply to the Board. Financial procedure"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/eng@/~part_V__cl_31> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/eng@/~part_V> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2015/2/eng@> .
